  su name module manuscript segment one request lane stage ob text "Use SEED CONCEPT and CARDINAL TRAINING SENTENCE as the main lane. Name the topic directly and naturally from the hook and source instead of opening with generic labels like the system, this framework, or this teaching. Prefer balance, fallible service, and raw-material/perfect-possibility framing. Use AFFAIRS OR ACTIVITIES only for one small example. Keep scarcity, domination, blockage, counterfeit, and misunderstanding language out of the paragraph's main establish move when a cleaner affirmative lane is available. Avoid taking the main mechanism from SURPRISES AND MISUNDERSTANDINGS or from channel or transparent-vessel language when other establish framing is available.\n\n" to name module manuscript segment one request be plus do
