  su name module manuscript segment one stage to name text module manuscript segment one out be module manuscript segment one checked do

  su name module manuscript segment two request begin stage ob text "PRIMARY_SOURCE_LANE:\nUse SURPRISES AND MISUNDERSTANDINGS as the main lane for this segment.\n\nOPTIONAL_SUPPORT_LANES:\nYou may use AFFAIRS OR ACTIVITIES, ORTHOGONAL FEATURES, CARDINAL SCENES AND IDIOMS, or one unused BRIEF MEMORY PHRASE as support.\n\nPOSITIVE_GOAL:\nBuild one coherent reveal arc from one misunderstanding family, or at most two closely complementary misunderstandings, in the source. Clarify what the source is actually saying instead of turning the segment into a mechanism lecture. A more specific correction nested inside the same broad misunderstanding field may still pass when Segment 1 established the general terrain and this segment sharpens the misuse, counterfeit, blockage, paradox, or consequence within it.\n\nSOURCE:\n" to name text module manuscript segment two request be text do
