  su name module manuscript segment two request avoid lane stage ob text "\n\nNEGATIVE_GUIDANCE:\nDo not build Segment 2 mainly from SEED CONCEPT, CARDINAL TRAINING SENTENCE, or the same explanatory lane already used in Segment 1. Prefer a different misunderstanding family and a different wording surface from Segment 1 whenever the source gives you multiple valid options. If Segment 1 already used one correction, contrast cluster, or misunderstanding family, do not reuse that same family as Segment 2's main reveal.\n" to name module manuscript segment two request be plus do
